Terminal 1 — Connect the phone

Connect the smartphone by USB with USB debugging enabled:

adb devices

Expected:

10BDAL16GL0007S    device

Configure Metro forwarding:

adb reverse --remove-all
adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081
adb reverse --list

Expected:

tcp:8081 tcp:8081


-

Terminal 2 — Start the backend

cd ~/Videos/backend-nextjs

pkill -f "node server.js" || true

node server.js

Keep this terminal open.



Terminal 3 — Start React Native Metro
cd ~/Videos/backend-nextjs/cctv-camera-native

adb reverse tcp:8081 tcp:8081

CI=1 npx react-native start \
  --reset-cache \
  </dev/null

Keep this terminal open.




Terminal 4 — Launch the camera application

First confirm that the app is installed:

adb shell pm path \
  com.cctvcameranative

Expected output similar to:

package:/data/app/.../base.apk



Finally Start the WEBRTC

Launch it:

adb shell am force-stop \
  com.cctvcameranative

adb shell monkey \
  -p com.cctvcameranative \
  -c android.intent.category.LAUNCHER \
  1